WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:03.730
This is a super interesting peek behind the
curtain.

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:09.419
There are now multiple reports out that privately
Donald Trump junior believes that Donald Trump

00:00:09.419 --> 00:00:13.039
is going to lose in November and lose badly.

00:00:13.039 --> 00:00:19.110
And fascinatingly, Don Junior reportedly believes
that not only Donald Trump but Don Junior

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:22.870
and maybe other members of the family are
going to be indicted and prosecuted.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.950
If Donald Trump loses loses in November.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:32.340
This is so interesting in terms of what it
says about their realization about what's

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.190
going on, despite always claiming everything
is great.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:39.989
So The New York Times is an interesting piece
about this, where they quote a prominent conservative

00:00:39.989 --> 00:00:44.360
activist who was interviewed on the condition
of anonymity, who told The New York Times

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:49.180
that Don Junior thinks they're going to lose
in November and that when they lose, they're

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:51.000
going to get, quote, really hurt.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.870
Meaning that federal prosecutions of not just
Donald Trump, but of his family and political

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:59.479
allies may be an inevitability.

00:00:59.479 --> 00:01:04.250
And according to the same conservative activists,
Don Junior believes that a Biden administration

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:10.250
will not peacefully transition, but they will
instead shoot the prisoners was the term that

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:17.400
Don Junior used, although that particular
piece was later denied by Andy Sarabia, who's

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.470
another Republican operative.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.020
So there's a few different things here.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:23.450
First, let's deal with the prosecution.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:27.820
You could say if you're innocent, you don't
fear being prosecuted.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:28.820
That's fair.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:33.510
But it's really easy to counter in this particular
case, because if you believe that there will

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:38.760
be politically motivated partizan political
attacks, you could take the position that

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:43.640
the next administration will prosecute you,
not because you committed crimes, but as political

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:44.640
payback.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.350
Now, there's, of course, no evidence of that.

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:51.200
If Joe Biden wins and there are prosecutions
of the Trump family, it would be because there's

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:55.560
evidence that they committed crimes, not because
of some personal vendetta by Joe Biden.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:01.020
But for me, the more important revelation
is about Donald Trump's desperation to win.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:07.630
If Don Junior really believes that there is
a risk of prosecution, if Joe Biden wins in

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:15.030
November, that must be at least somewhat in
Donald Trump's mind, at least a little bit.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:20.190
And it would explain Donald Trump's willingness
to do anything to win in November.

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:22.560
And we've talked about this before.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:27.500
Donald Trump may genuinely believe that he
must win in November to avoid prosecution.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.620
I actually don't think it's likely.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:35.160
I think the Trump organization will be gone
after for financial crimes and it won't touch

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.750
Trump personally.

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:41.180
But if Trump thinks it's a possibility, he
is like a cornered animal.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.670
That's the analogy we've been using.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:45.010
And cornered animals behave erratically.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:50.860
That tells us why Trump will use the post
office and try to suppress vote by mail and

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:55.680
try to close polling places and contests the
election results and call it rigged and welcome

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:56.760
foreign interference.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:03:02.459
Because Trump may see this not just as fighting
for his political life and his reputation

00:03:02.459 --> 00:03:07.930
as he may see it, but as the way to keep himself
out of prison or at least out of a courtroom

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:09.090
for the rest of his life.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:14.270
Now, just imagine, for the sake of following
this, imagine if Biden wins and makes Hillary

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.380
Clinton attorney general.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:23.650
And imagine that she oversees prosecution
of the Trump family when it was Trump in 2016

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.540
running on lock her up.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:29.060
I don't deny that there would be something
interesting about that.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:33.489
But let's put it aside here and not really
put the cart before the horse.

00:03:33.489 --> 00:03:39.240
The real takeaway is that a quarter cornered
animal will lash out in ways that are incredibly

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.180
dangerous and violent.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.840
And that's what we have to expect over the
next 10 weeks here.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:48.069
It is 10 weeks to the day today until November
3rd.

00:03:48.069 --> 00:03:54.760
Now, my real concern is that Trump won't lose
in November and that I can't exactly put my

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:55.760
finger on it.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:04:00.410
But over the last two weeks, I've started
to lean closer to thinking a Trump reelection

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.990
is more likely than it was a couple of weeks
ago.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:04.450
Polling might be a part of it.

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:05.880
Polling is certainly tightened a little bit.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:09.970
In late June, Biden was averaging plus 10
nationally.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:13.350
Now Biden is averaging plus seven point five.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.120
So that's part of it.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:20.940
But there's something intangible that I can't
quite put my finger on that has me more worried

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:24.930
today about a Trump reelection than I was
two to three weeks ago.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:27.030
We know what you think it might be.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:32.350
We'll have more on this on The David Pakman
Show Instagram page at The David Pakman Show.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:05:23.520
While you're there, follow me on Instagram
at David Pakman.

